Accept, store and broadcast whether a native harness runs in fast mode.

external_session_usage accepts data.fast_mode (a boolean), stores it as "true"
or "false" in the omnigent.fast_mode session label for page loads, and adds it
to the session.usage SSE event. Like a rate-limits-only post, a post carrying
only fast_mode skips the cost roll-up. Pairs with the runner patch
0004-fast-mode.patch and the web patch 0009-composer-fast-mode.patch. Applies
after 0002-rate-limits.patch. Base: omnigent v0.15.0 (c8b9b85f822f).

